<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><title>Healthcare Management System</title></head>
<body>
<h1>Healthcare Management System</h1>
<p>ASP.NET MVC 5 / Web API 2 / .NET Framework 4.8</p>
<p>No ASP.NET Core / .NET Core.</p>
<h3>Business flows</h3>
<ul>
<li>Patient registration and profile management</li>
<li>Provider registration and provider lookup</li>
<li>Appointment scheduling, rescheduling and cancellation</li>
<li>Eligibility and insurance verification</li>
<li>Encounter creation and clinical-service recording</li>
<li>Medical claim creation and claim status tracking</li>
<li>Claim validation and adjudication workflow</li>
<li>Payment/claim settlement tracking</li>
<li>Patient billing and outstanding balance</li>
<li>Search, dashboard and operational reporting</li>
<li>Audit/history tracking</li>
</ul>
</body>
</html>
